 "body": "This commit fixes some highlighting issues due to multiple keyword\nentries.\n\nThe missing C++ keywords have been added.\n\nA set of standard fixed sized integers has been added also: `uint8_t`,\n`int32_t`,...\n\nThis also resolves #3175 \n",
